Integrate cloud VDU to NetAct
    [Arguments]  ${kubeconfig_yaml_file}=/home/ute/template/config  ${gnb_index}=0  ${netact_index}=0
    ...          ${use_cloud_dn}=False    ${parameters}=${None}
    [Documentation]  This keyword is used to integrate cloud to NetAct.
    ...
    ...  *AUTHOR* runrun.shou@nokia-sbell.com
    ...
    ...    |    =Input Parameters=     | =Man.= | =Description= |
    ...    | kubeconfig_yaml_file   | No |  Kubeconfig yaml file. Default is /home/ute/template/config. |
    ...    | netact_index | No | NetAct index in testline configurtion file. Default is None. |
    ...    | use_cloud_dn | No | NetAct Integrate by clouddn. Default is False. |
    ...    *RETURN VALUE*
    ...   integrate result
    ${kubeconfig_json_path}  generic_utils.generate_log_path_with_log_type
    ${cloudID}  tl_config.get_du_global_bts_id  gnb_index=${gnb_index}
    ${kubeconfig_json_file}  netact_lcm.Kubeyaml_to_kubejson_file  cloudID=${cloudID}  yamlFilePath=${kubeconfig_yaml_file}  jsonFilePath=${kubeconfig_json_path}
    ${integrate_result}    run keyword if   '${use_cloud_dn}' == 'False'
    ...    netact_ope.integrate_cloud_to_netAct_taf  cloudID=${cloudID}  kubeconfig_json_file=${kubeconfig_json_file}  netact_index=${netact_index}
    ...    ELSE    netact_ope.integrate_cloud_to_netAct_taf  cloud_dn=PLMN-PLMN/CLOUD-${cloudID}  kubeconfig_json_file=${kubeconfig_json_file}  netact_index=${netact_index}
    ...    parameters=${parameters}
    [Return]    ${integrate_result}

