Create manual VCU SCF plan for Netact
    [Arguments]  ${swversion}  ${secretname}  ${deployplanname}  ${conversion_toolpath}=/home/ute  ${gnb_index}=0  ${netact_index}=0
    ...          ${artifactory_location}=HZ
    [Documentation]  This keyword is used to create manual VCU SCF plan for Netact.
    ...
    ...  *AUTHOR* runrun.shou@nokia-sbell.com
    ...
    ...    |    =Input Parameters=     | =Man.= | =Description= |
    ...    | swversion | Yes | vcu software version like: vCUCNF00_0.250.13592 |
    ...    | secretname   | Yes  | secretname, it must be same with create scret SSD  |
    ...    | deployplanname   | Yes  | netact deploy plan name, like:  vcuManualDeployPlan |
    ...    | conversion_toolpath   | No  | a temp path for conversion tool store |
    ...    | gnb_index   | No |  gnb index in testline configurtion file. Default is 0. |
    ...    | netact_index   | No | NetAct index in testline configurtion file. Default is None.  |
    ...    | artifactory_location | No | prefered artifactory server [HZ|ESP] |
    ...    *RETURN VALUE*
    ...   scf plan name
    ${productname}  Set Variable  vcu
    ${cluster_chart_file}  ${prerequisite_chart_file}  ${main_chart_file}  netact_cli.get_chart_name_by_swversion_from_lcmserver  swversion=${swversion}  netact_index=${netact_index}
    ${scfplan_path}  generic_utils.generate_log_path_with_log_type
    log to console    ${scfplan_path}
    ${cu_global_bts_id}  tl_config.get_cu_global_bts_id  gnb_index=${gnb_index}
    log to console    ${cu_global_bts_id}
    ${cu_namespace}  tl_config.get_vcu_namespace  gnb_index=${gnb_index}
    log to console    ${cu_namespace}
    ${cluster_chart_parameterfile}  ${prerequisite_chart_parameterfile}  ${main_chart_parameterfile}  tl_config.get_vcu_chart_yaml_filename  gnb_index=${gnb_index}
    log to console  ${cluster_chart_parameterfile}  ${prerequisite_chart_parameterfile}  ${main_chart_parameterfile}
    ${vcu_scfplan_name}  netact_lcm.create_vcu_vdu_scfplan_file  ${conversion_toolpath}   ${scfplan_path}  ${deployplanname}
     ...    ${cu_global_bts_id}  ${swversion}  ${cu_namespace}  ${cluster_chart_file}  ${cluster_chart_parameterfile}
     ...    ${prerequisite_chart_file}  ${prerequisite_chart_parameterfile}  ${main_chart_file}  ${main_chart_parameterfile}   ${secretname}  ${productname}
     ...    ${artifactory_location}
    [Return]    ${vcu_scfplan_name}

