    ...    *AUTHOR* runrun.shou@nokia-sbell.com
    ...
    ...    | netact_index   | No |NetAct instance name. Default value is None |
    ...    *RETURN VALUE*
    ...     Netact LCM Harbor CCRADMIN Password
    ...
